---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ui } from '../../i18n/ui.ts';

const t = ui.en || ui.de;
---

<Layout lang='en'>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>News</h1>
        
        <article class="news-item">
            <img src="/images/ATT44591.jpg" alt="Black Belt Training 2026" />
            <div class="news-content">
                <h2>Black Belt Trainings 2026</h2>
                <p class="meta">By Silvan Buchecker | November 3, 2025</p>
                <p>The black belt trainings will take place on the following dates in 2026: Attention! We have moved. The Basel Dojo is now located at Winkelriedplatz 6, 4053 Basel. Black belt trainings cost CHF 20 per practitioner.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="news-item">
            <img src="/images/IMG-20250602-WA0018-1-1024x768.jpg" alt="Taikai Portugal" />
            <div class="news-content">
                <h2>Swiss Delegation at Taikai in Portugal</h2>
                <p class="meta">By Silvan Buchecker | November 3, 2025</p>
                <p>A Swiss delegation participated in the Taikai from October 23-25 in Lisbon. The three-day training event was held to celebrate the 50th anniversary of Shorinji Kempo Portugal.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="news-item">
            <img src="/images/Gruppe_5-1-768x512.jpg" alt="Japanfest Bern" />
            <div class="news-content">
                <h2>Japanfest Bern 22.05.2022</h2>
                <p class="meta">By Silvan Buchecker | May 24, 2022</p>
                <p>On May 22, 2022, Dojo Muri, with support from Dojo Basel and Dojo Aubonne, had the opportunity to present at the Japanfest (Historisches Museum Bern) through a workshop.</p>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .container {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 20px;
    }
    h1 {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        color: #111;
    }
    .news-item {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .news-item img {
        width: 150px;
        height: 100px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .news-content h2 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
        color: #c00;
    }
    .meta {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #666;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
</style>